 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Depends what you value. Some people say the difference is thin for people who use a computer all day, others say it' worth every penny for peace of mind. Then it' worth thinking about. A small camera the size of a nail polish bottle gives video that feels like it comes from the moon. You' miss the main point. A cheap webcam with a good camera is usually several orders of magnitude worse. Then basic laptop with a webcam is probably good enough. You' only see difference if there's bright light straight at the camera from one side.",
